  "description": "Dear Team,\n\nFor the upcoming ME\u2011ICA run we will use the following parameters: the baseline timing is set to zero, and the repetition time (TR) is 2.0\u202fseconds. The processing will be allocated to four CPU cores, and we have enabled MNI space normalization. We will not retain intermediate files after the analysis, and axialisation will be performed (i.e., the *no\u2011axialize* flag is off). The API key required for authentication is **abcd1234**.\n\nOur functional data are supplied in DICOM format, while the anatomical reference image is provided as a NIfTI file. Please confirm that these settings match your expectations before we launch the pipeline."
